{"title":"Reborn As The Enemy Prince","synopsis":"Aku bisa mendengarkan suara senandung dari kehidupan di telingaku Sulit sekali yah untuk bernapas\nAku mengangkat kepalaku dan menatap jauh dalam kejauhan\nNamun penglihatanku mulai buram hingga aku tidak bisa melihat apaapa\nCahaya mulai menghilang\nItulah ingatan terakhirku\nSaat aku membuka mataku ternyata ini 10 tahun sebelum ingatan itu terjadi\nDan yang terburuk dari semuanya aku menjadi Pangeran Ketiga Kyris negara musuh yang mendorong kehancuran Secretia Pangeran Calian\n\nBern merupakan sang Pangeran Mahkota Secretia yang bertempur dan mati dalam perang melawan Kyris\nTapi dia terbangun 10 tahun di masa lalu sebagai Pangeran Ketiga Kyris yang pemalu Calian","alternative_title":"Updating","author":"Ja Seo Hyeon","artist":"","genres":["Action","Adventure","Comedy","Fantasy"],"chapters":[{"id":"da705edb-b899-4750-83a4-9100a51021a0","number":"115","title":"Chapter 115","date":"2026-05-30","images":[]},{"id":"8e482797-28f6-4b2d-a7da-e7c67d7871df","number":"114","title":"Chapter 114","date":"2026-05-23","images":[]},{"id":"4ca136cc-85d0-4792-ad12-313c8832b926","number":"113","title":"Chapter 113","date":"2026-05-16","images":[]},{"id":"94e67ff3-7ca0-41c7-b99b-e16be8e52f70","number":"112","title":"Chapter 112","date":"2026-05-10","images":[]},{"id":"111168d5-cbef-4cf7-a3be-388b195821f0","number":"111","title":"Chapter 111","date":"2026-05-02","images":[]},{"id":"e9d230dc-dac7-4244-9623-f4cad1860cc6","number":"110","title":"Chapter 110","date":"2026-04-27","images":[]},{"id":"1e46cdf2-7711-459b-bd9c-1651c13602da","number":"109","title":"Chapter 109","date":"2026-04-26","images":[]},{"id":"90494f12-26f3-48fb-b503-49a84b5b1aef","number":"108","title":"Chapter 108","date":"2026-04-26","images":[]},{"id":"d3a84a16-c0e3-4295-ab43-7344666d71b0","number":"107","title":"Chapter 107","date":"2026-04-26","images":[]},{"id":"e4c30b58-6fc0-4e59-86c5-74fb00817d70","number":"106","title":"Chapter 106","date":"2026-04-26","images"